OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally dry with sunny
OL,6,Fintervals, but there is a risk of
OL,7,Fisolated showers first thing, these
OL,8,Fdying out during the morning. Winds
OL,9,Ffalling light, and feeling warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening with sunny
OL,13,Fspells, then clear spells overnight.
OL,14,FCloud perhaps thickening a little in
OL,15,Fthe north by dawn. Becoming breezy
OL,16,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
